<!--Post: 7688--><!--Time: 1108656718-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7688"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 8:11 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The 10:00 news conference just rapped up. Lt. Ken Landwehr said that two btk communications ahve been confirmed to have come from btk. The package dropped in the UPS drop box and the package found in Murdock Park. Also that jewelry was found in both the Post Toasties box and the package delivered yesterday to Fox.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7688-->
<!--Post: 7695--><!--Time: 1108658389-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7695"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Neechi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Neechi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 8:39 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here&#39;s a link to KSN&#39;s coverage of the BTK press conference by WPD. <BR> <BR>Go to <a href="http://www.ksn.com" target=_top>www.ksn.com</a> and there is a breaking news thing at the top of the page, saying unedited video of press conference!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7695-->
<!--Post: 7724--><!--Time: 1108666254-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7724"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Maxgravis<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Maxgravis<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 10:50 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Why in the heck give a press conference like that? <BR>We already know that stuff. Why don&#39;t this reporters ask the police some tough questions? Give the public knowledge, we can solve this case. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7724-->
<!--Post: 7726--><!--Time: 1108666697-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7726"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Kansasgirl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Kansasgirl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 10:58 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This is the information released.  <BR><a href="http://www.kake.com/home/headlines/1274817.html" target=_top>http://www.kake.com/home/headlines/1274817.html</a> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7726-->
<!--Post: 7736--><!--Time: 1108668928-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7736"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Neechi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Neechi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 11:35 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I completely agree Max.  I understand that they have to keep something private just to exclude any wackos that might try to cop to the crimes.  However, the Unabomber was only caught because his brother read his &#34;manifesto&#34; in the papers.  The WPD or the media outlets, must be willing to release in their entirity confirmed communications from BTK.  Someone out here knows this guy, and it&#39;s obvious that straight up police work, isn&#39;t stirring the kool aid, so it&#39;s time to think and act outside the box and show the jewelry, let us read the actual words of BTK, that&#39;s the only way I think he&#39;s going to be identified.  Unless of course, in his old age he becomes a bad driver, that tends to mess up serial killers. : &#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7736-->
<!--Post: 7779--><!--Time: 1108680835-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7779"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Marga<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Marga<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 2:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Do you think the following &#40;from the transcript of Landwehr&#39;s statement on KAKE.com: <a href="http://www.kake.com/home/headlines/1274817.html" target=_top>http://www.kake.com/home/headlines/1274817.html</a>&#41; is directed at BTK?: <BR> <BR>&#34;During the first media briefing held last March after BTK resurfaced I said the BTK investigation is the most challenging case I have ever worked on and that BTK would be every interesting to talk with. I still contend that this is our most challenging case, but I am very pleased with the ongoing dialog through these letters.&#34; <BR> <BR>LE is telling/encouraging BTK to keep communicating? <BR> <BR>Marga<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7779-->
<!--Post: 7810--><!--Time: 1108688526-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7810"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Purple<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Purple<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 5:02 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t know if this post belongs here, but here it goes.  I live in Wichita.  I have been watching KAKE TV lately, and although I know it is sweeps month, I find it odd that every night we are seeing short video from the past.  They label it &#34;A piece of KAKE&#34;.  With all the communications from BTK, I have to wonder are the two connected.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7810-->
